The bug report:
> `semver.inc` resets the prerelease counter when the identifier contains a dot.
> `semver.inc('5.2.0-rc.next.3', 'prerelease', 'rc.next')` returns `5.2.0-rc.next.0`, expected `5.2.0-rc.next.4`.
